<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-jinshu" book-id="b-jinshu-008" chapter-id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang" source-id="s-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang">
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:command" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">三月，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:command:m0003" ref="nzw_thb_ddp">姚襄</persName>入于許昌，以太尉<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:command:m0013" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲征討大都督以討之。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:yishui" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">秋八月己亥，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:yishui:m0006" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>及<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:yishui:m0009" ref="nzw_thb_ddp">姚襄</persName>戰于伊水，大敗之，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:yishui:m0020" ref="nzw_thb_ddp">襄</persName>走平陽，徙其餘衆三千餘家于江漢之間，執<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:yishui:m0040" ref="ahd_v7t_hy3">周成</persName>而歸。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:rank" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十一月，封太尉<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:rank:m0007" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓溫</persName>爲南郡公，<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:rank:m0014" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">溫</persName>弟<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:rank:m0016" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AE">沖</persName>爲豐城縣公，子<persName id="c-jinshu-008-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:rank:m0024" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AAB">濟</persName>爲臨賀郡公。</p>
</text>
